Keep highlighted editor text and its native caret in the same font.

The Codex theme gives pre elements a monospace font outside Tailwind
utilities. Use a neutral div for the aria-hidden copy so it receives the
same inherited or caller-selected font as the textarea, in both editors.
Base: omnigent v0.18.0 (a8676d23e88d), after 0001-0015.

